      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "- Choose on of 16 elements to pick from.\n- Chosen element reveals an arrow
    pointing one of 8 directions.\n- Once the element reveals a direction, the scene
    transitions to the board of 25 spots with a character on a dance pole.\n- The
    character is first located at the center spot.\n- Each of 25 spots has its own
    value, either one of the prizes below:\n              - Coin Prize\n              -
    Any Jackpot excluding Grand Jackpot\n- The character moves towards the direction
    the element revealed and win the prize written on the spot that the character
    just landed.\n- 10 consecutive successful moves awards Grand Jackpot."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5316d286fa94a894888ee12767189de0, type: 2}
